0 Cascade — physical elbow-lock control
0 Name: cascade-control.ldr
0 Author: CrispStrobe
0 !LICENSE BSD-3-Clause : see ../licenses/cascade-control.txt
0 !LDRAW_ORG Unofficial_Model
0 // One fixed SPIKE Prime hub and one medium angular motor on explicit port A.
0 // Saved crank points downward; crank radius40LDU, upper200LDU, lower120LDU.
0 // +Y is down; parallel swing axes are +Z; frame bottom is Y450LDU.
0 // Six extra real pieces fix the elbow. Original elbow pin remains present.
0 // Reset to this saved assembly before programs/cascade.bw.
0 // No custom parts, synthetic joints, gears, bands or rope directives.
0 // Standard LDraw meshes remain external under their original notices.
